#. RenderingServer.DECAL_FILTER_NEAREST_MIPMAPS
#: doc/classes/RenderingServer.xml
msgid "Nearest-neighbor filter for decals (use for pixel art decals). Isotropic mipmaps are used for rendering, which means decals at a distance will look smooth but blurry. This has roughly the same performance cost as not using mipmaps."
